# Briefato — Caddy site block.
# Insert into the live Caddyfile / the stack-54 compose heredoc (see skill: devops/portainer,
# "Caddy CMD heredoc regenerates Caddyfile on every start"). Indentation must match the anchor line.
#
# Staging host: briefato.sabry.io (LAN-internal DNS — *.sabry.io resolves only via Technitium).
# A public launch needs a real public domain; then swap the site address and keep `tls internal`
# OR let Caddy obtain a Let's Encrypt certificate once the domain is public.

briefato.sabry.io {
    tls internal
    import common
    import crowdsec_protect
    encode zstd gzip
    reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8085 {
        header_up Host {upstream_hostport}
        header_up X-Forwarded-Proto {scheme}
    }
}
